 ],
 "Cards": [
  {
   "ID": "card-legend",
   "Title": "Legend",
   "Color": "slate",
   "Legend": true,
   "Lines": [],
   "X": 40,
   "Y": 1390,
   "W": 500,
   "H": 390
  },
  {
   "ID": "card-data-plane",
   "Title": "Request path · data plane",
   "Color": "cyan",
   "Legend": false,
   "Lines": [
    "[1] A signed-in user calls https://\u003capp\u003e.staging.acme.example/api. TLS already ended at the edge team.",
    "[2] eg checks the GitLab id-token cookie and the route's allowedGroups, then proxies plain HTTP to the backend Service.",
    "[3] The backend queries its own CNPG cluster with DATABASE_URL.",
    "[4] It calls another app on its public hostname from \u003cAPP\u003e_URL. hostAliases pins that name to eg-internal, which routes /api only.",
    "Other apps call this one the same way, unauthenticated.",
    "To verify: whether the id-token cookie reaches the backend, i.e. whether the app can read the user's identity."
   ],
   "X": 560,
   "Y": 1390,
   "W": 520,
   "H": 390
  },
  {
   "ID": "card-control-plane",
   "Title": "Background · control plane",
   "Color": "violet",
   "Legend": false,
   "Lines": [
    "Argo CD renders generic-app-chart: team values from app-configs first, platform baseline last, so the baseline wins on images, security and vault[].",
    "The migration Job runs as a PreSync hook before each rollout.",
    "[A] VSO reads the app's Vault path with the role pinned by the baseline, and writes it as a K8s Secret.",
    "CNPG creates \u003capp\u003e-db and publishes \u003capp\u003e-db-app, the source of DATABASE_*.",
    "Image Updater bumps the image tag in app-configs on every rc build."
   ],
   "X": 1100,
   "Y": 1390,
   "W": 460,
   "H": 390
  },
  {
   "ID": "card-contract",
   "Title": "Runtime contract · what the pod sees",
   "Color": "indigo",
   "Legend": false,
   "Lines": [
    "**Env, always:** APP_NAME, APP_COMPONENT, APP_ENV, APP_DOMAIN, POD_NAME, POD_NAMESPACE, LOG_LEVEL.",
    "**Env, database:** DATABASE_HOST, _PORT, _NAME, _USER, _PASSWORD, _URL (driver from urlScheme).",
    "**Env, other apps:** \u003cAPP\u003e_URL for the 8 known apps, e.g. BOOKING_URL=http://booking.staging.acme.example.",
    "**Secrets:** each vault[] entry becomes a Secret, injected as env via injectInto. No files, no Vault token. Rotation needs a restart.",
    "**Sandbox:** non-root uid 1000, read-only root, writable /tmp 64Mi, all capabilities dropped, seccomp RuntimeDefault.",
    "**Must expose:** HTTP on 8000 (backend) or 8080 (frontend), /health/live, /health/ready, /metrics. JSON logs on stdout.",
    "**Sizing:** 1 replica, 100m/128Mi request, 500m/512Mi limit, required anti-affinity."
   ],
   "X": 1580,
   "Y": 1390,
   "W": 620,
   "H": 390
  },
  {
   "ID": "card-gaps",
   "Title": "Gaps between docs and code",
   "Color": "orange",
   "Legend": false,
   "Lines": [
    "!!G1!! **East-west auth.** eg-internal has no SecurityPolicy. Any app pod can call any app's /api, and the callee cannot tell who is calling.",
    "!!G2!! **No broker.** Docs promise RabbitMQ with one vhost per app. Not deployed, RABBITMQ_URL not injected, egress rule off. The template's publisher and worker cannot run.",
    "!!G3!! **Archetype vs contract.** Backends serve /health and /ready, not /health/live and /health/ready. Frontends run stock nginx as root on port 80.",
    "!!G4!! **Observability.** /metrics is required but no Prometheus runs. Logs only through kubectl.",
